
    The year is 2032.  Growing mistrust and suspicion among the governments
of the world have spawned frequent and bloody border skirmishes.  In an
effort to reduce the amount of human carnage governments have started
employing cyborg technology to create the perfect soldier.  Unfortunately,
cyborg techonoloy is still in its infancy, as governments test and refine,
test and refine.  Your government, confident in its newest incarnation of
cybernetic organisms, has established the ultimate testing grounds from
which the finest soldiers will emerge.

    This is where you come in.  You are a cyborg, one of the latest.  You,
as well as many more like you, have been transported to a secret government
complex far underneath the surface of the Earth.  Your mission is simple:
kill or be killed.  The complex has an ample of supply of weapons and
munitions of varying power which are at your disposal.  Your wits and a
smoking gun are your only chance for survival.  Are you up to the
challenge?

